### Enhancements

* Make `conda self update` target conda and all installed conda plugins by
  default, allowing their dependencies to update. Explicit `--all` now uses
  the same targeted update instead of updating every installed package in base.
  Use the new `--conda-only` option to retain the previous default of updating
  conda and its dependencies. `--plugin` continues to target one plugin.
  The three explicit update options are mutually exclusive.
